OL,3,AAustralian MP critically injured after
OL,4,Abeing hit by car in apparent attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FAustralian MP Helen Haines is
OL,7,Fcritically ill in hospital in Melbourne
OL,8,Fafter being hit by a car in what Prime
OL,9,FMinister Anthony Albanese says may have
OL,10,Fbeen a deliberate attack.
OL,12,FThe independent MP, 65, was struck
OL,13,Foutside her constituency office in
OL,14,FWangaratta, in the state of Victoria,
OL,15,Fon Monday afternoon.
OL,17,FA man, 43, from the nearby town of
OL,18,FTarrawingee was detained at the scene
OL,19,Fby a passerby and police say a knife
OL,20,Fwas found in the car.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
