OL,4,Abeing hit by car in apparent attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating whether it was
OL,7,Fan "intentional act" but say they do
OL,8,Fnot believe there is an "ongoing threat
OL,9,Fto the community".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
