OL,3,AUkrainians dying because US restricting
OL,4,Aintelligence sharing, Zelensky adviser
OL,5,Atells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe adviser also said restrictions to
OL,8,FUkraine's use of the Starlink internet
OL,9,Fnetwork were ongoing.
OL,11,FThe White House said there had been no
OL,12,Fchanges to intelligence sharing with
OL,13,FUkraine.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
