OL,3,AKenya cult leader who told parents to
OL,4,Astarve children guilty of 191 murders
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of a Kenyan doomsday cult,
OL,7,FPaul Mackenzie, has been found guilty
OL,8,Fof murdering 191 people, all but one of
OL,9,Fthem children.
OL,11,FMackenzie ordered members of his cult
OL,12,Fto starve their children to death so
OL,13,Fthey could "meet Jesus".
OL,15,FHis doctrine said that education was
OL,16,Fforbidden and modern medicine was
OL,17,F"evil".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
